	summary: "List session threads",
	description: "Lists the threads for the session’s resource, most-recently-updated first. Pass `limit` to return only the newest N (e.g. for a sidebar). Pass `tags` (a JSON-encoded object) to scope the list to threads matching every tag — e.g. `{ projectPath }` so git worktrees sharing a resourceId each see only their own threads.",
